{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "client1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "# External Client\n\nHermes / OpenAI SDK\n\nUses OpenAI-compatible API",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "proxy1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 350,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "# Bielik OpenAI Proxy\n\nFastAPI Application\n`bielik_openai_proxy/app.py`\n\nEndpoints:\n- `GET /healthz`\n- `GET /v1/models`\n- `POST /v1/chat/completions`",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "auth1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 350,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "# Authentication Layer\n\n1. Validates `TRIAL_API_KEY`\n2. Fetches Google ID Token\n3. Uses `PROXY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT`\n4. IAM: `roles/run.invoker`",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "transform1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 350,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "# Request/Response Transform\n\n**Request:** OpenAI → Ollama\n- Converts chat.completions format\n- Handles streaming config\n\n**Response:** Ollama → OpenAI\n- Parses NDJSON streams\n- Builds OpenAI-compatible chunks\n- Adds proper metadata",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "upstream1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 850,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "# Upstream Service\n\nPrivate Bielik LLM\nCloud Run Service\n\n**Location:** europe-west1\n(St. Ghislain, Belgium)\n\n**Hardware:**\n- 1x NVIDIA L4 GPU\n- 8 vCPU\n- 16GB RAM\n\n**Model:**\nSpeakLeash/bielik-4.5b-v3.0-instruct:Q8_0\n(8-bit quantized)",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "config1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "# Configuration\n\nEnvironment Variables:\n- `TRIAL_API_KEY`\n- `UPSTREAM_LLM_URL`\n- `UPSTREAM_MODEL_NAME`\n- `PROXY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT`\n- `REQUEST_TIMEOUT` (600s)",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "stream1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 850,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "# Streaming Handler\n\n**Non-streaming:**\n- Forces stream=False upstream\n- Merges chunks\n- Returns single response\n\n**Streaming:**\n- Forwards SSE chunks\n- Emits terminal [DONE]",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "group1",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -50,
      "y": -50,
      "width": 1300,
      "height": 700,
      "label": "Bielik OpenAI Proxy - Internal Architecture",
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
